  "result": "I added project muting as specified. The full test suite passes (617 tests) and typecheck and lint are clean. I also ran a scratch test covering the guards, idempotency, the `notify()` rules and the digest mute/unmute behaviour; it passed and I deleted it.\n\n- **Storage:** mutes are saved in a new `project_mutes` table, and each notification now records which project it is about. Both are in the drizzle schema and in `migrate.ts`. The new column only comes with the table-creation statement, so an existing database would need that column added by hand.\n- **`notify()` rules:** personal kinds about a muted project are sent without email. Other kinds are skipped for that recipient.\n- **Digest:** notifications about projects the recipient currently mutes are left out, and the entry cap is applied after that.\n\nNo visible test needed changing. I didn't add any UI or server actions for muting.",
